{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "JiaClaw HTTP API",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "JiaClaw 个人持久化智能体运行时 HTTP 接口草图。\n\n鉴权：\n- Bearer：当配置了 `JIACLAW_API_TOKEN` 或 `[http].api_token` 时，`/api/*` 需要 `Authorization: Bearer <token>` 或 `X-Api-Token`。未配置时无需鉴权（本地开发友好）。\n- Webhook secret：当配置了 `JIACLAW_WEBHOOK_SECRET` 或 `[http].webhook_secret` 时，`POST /hooks/inbound` 需要 `X-Webhook-Secret`。\n- Telegram secret：当配置了 `JIACLAW_TELEGRAM_SECRET` 或 `[http].telegram_secret` 时，`POST /hooks/telegram` 需要 `X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token`（Telegram 官方 secret token）。未配置则与本地 webhook 一样开放。\n- Slack signing secret：当配置了 `JIACLAW_SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET` 或 `[http].slack_signing_secret` 时，`POST /hooks/slack` 校验 `X-Slack-Signature` + `X-Slack-Request-Timestamp`（官方 v0 HMAC-SHA256，时间窗 ±5 分钟）。签名使用原始 body 字节。未配置则开放（开发友好）。\n- Discord 公钥：当配置了 `JIACLAW_DISCORD_PUBLIC_KEY` 或 `[http].discord_public_key` 时，`POST /hooks/discord` 校验 `X-Signature-Ed25519` + `X-Signature-Timestamp`（官方 Ed25519，消息为 `timestamp + raw body`）。未配置则开放（开发友好）。\n\nTelegram 出站：当配置了 `JIACLAW_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` 或 `[http].telegram_bot_token` 时，成功得到 assistant 回复后会调用 Bot `sendMessage` 推回聊天（文本按 4096 截断）。出站失败仍返回 200 + 原 `reply`，避免 Telegram webhook 重试；响应可带 `delivered` / `delivery_error`。未配置 token 时仅同步 JSON。用 `setWebhook` 将公网 `https://…/hooks/telegram` 登记到 Bot，并可带 `secret_token`。\n\nSlack 出站：当配置了 `JIACLAW_SLACK_BOT_TOKEN` 或 `[http].slack_bot_token` 时，成功得到 assistant 回复后会调用 `chat.postMessage` 推回 channel（文本按 40000 截断）。出站失败仍 200 + 原 `reply`，避免 Slack Events 重试。\n\nDiscord 出站：当配置了 `JIACLAW_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN` 或 `[http].discord_bot_token` 时，`POST /hooks/discord` 立即返回 `type=5` deferred ACK，后台 chat 完成后 `PATCH /webhooks/{application_id}/{interaction_token}/messages/@original` 编辑原始回复（文本按 2000 截断）。未配置 token 时仍 ACK 并记录 session，但无法 follow-up。长任务必须走 deferred（Discord 要求 3s 内 ACK）。\n\n限流：当配置了 `JIACLAW_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE` 或 `[http].rate_limit_per_minute`（正整数）时，`/api/*` 与 `/hooks/inbound`、`/hooks/telegram`、`/hooks/slack`、`/hooks/discord` 超限返回 429，并带 `Retry-After`。`GET /health` 不限流。\n\nSession TTL：当配置了 `JIACLAW_SESSION_TTL_SECS` 或 `[http].session_ttl_secs`（正整数）时，闲置超过该秒数的会话会从 store 删除。`GET /api/sessions` 只返回未过期项；对已过期 id 的 GET/DELETE 与不存在一致（GET 为 404）。create/chat/get/list 会刷新 last_accessed。\n\n请求追踪：所有响应回写 `X-Request-Id`。若请求未携带该头，服务端生成 UUID。\n\n可选 SSE：`POST /api/chat` 在 `Accept: text/event-stream` 或 body `stream: true` 时返回 `text/event-stream`（事件：meta / token / tool / done / error）。未请求流式时 JSON 响应不变。当前为整轮 tool loop 完成后的分块推送；Brokerrouter 真流式后续。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/",
      "description": "当前 JiaClaw 进程"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    { "name": "health", "description": "健康检查" },
    { "name": "chat", "description": "聊天与会话" },
    { "name": "catalog", "description": "工具与技能目录" },
    { "name": "hooks", "description": "Webhook / Telegram / Slack / Discord 入站（可选出站）" },
    { "name": "discovery", "description": "API 发现" }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["health"],
        "summary": "健康检查",
        "operationId": "getHealth",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "服务可用",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/chat": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["chat"],
        "summary": "发送聊天消息",
        "operationId": "postChat",
        "description": "默认同步 JSON。当请求头 `Accept: text/event-stream` 或 body `stream: true`（二者其一即可）时返回 Server-Sent Events。鉴权失败仍为 JSON 401。当前 token 事件为整轮完成后的分块推送；Brokerrouter 真流式后续。",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "聊天响应（JSON 或 SSE）",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatResponse" }
              },
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatSseStream" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/sessions": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["chat"],
        "summary": "列出会话",
        "operationId": "listSessions",
        "description": "返回内存中当前未过期会话摘要（id 与 message_count）。启用 Session TTL 时会先清理过期项。落盘开启时也以内存 store 为准，与 chat/delete 一致。",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "会话列表",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListSessionsResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["chat"],
        "summary": "创建会话",
        "operationId": "createSession",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "新会话 ID",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateSessionResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/sessions/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["chat"],
        "summary": "读取会话历史",
        "operationId": "getSession",
        "description": "返回内存中该会话的消息列表。不存在或已过期返回 404。落盘开启时也以内存 store 为准。",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string" }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "会话消息",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GetSessionResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["chat"],
        "summary": "删除会话",
        "operationId": "deleteSession",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string" }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "删除结果（不存在时 success=false）",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DeleteSessionResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/tools": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["catalog"],
        "summary": "列出已注册工具",
        "operationId": "listTools",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "工具列表",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolsResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/skills": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["catalog"],
        "summary": "列出已发现技能",
        "operationId": "listSkills",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "技能列表",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SkillsResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/openapi.json": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["discovery"],
        "summary": "OpenAPI 3 文档草图",
        "operationId": "getOpenApi",
        "description": "鉴权与 GET /api/tools 一致：未配置 API token 时可匿名访问；已启用 token 时需 Bearer 或 X-Api-Token。",
        "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }, { "apiToken": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OpenAPI 3 JSON",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "type": "object" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/hooks/inbound": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["hooks"],
        "summary": "Webhook 入站",
        "operationId": "inboundWebhook",
        "security": [{ "webhookSecret": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InboundWebhookRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "入站处理结果",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InboundWebhookResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Webhook secret 不匹配",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookUnauthorized" }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/hooks/telegram": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["hooks"],
        "summary": "Telegram Bot 入站",
        "operationId": "inboundTelegram",
        "description": "接收 Telegram Bot API Update JSON，将 `message.text` / `edited_message.text` 映射到 session `telegram:{chat.id}` 并走现有 agent chat 路径。无文本的 update 返回 200 并带跳过说明。配置了 `JIACLAW_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` / `[http].telegram_bot_token` 时，成功回复后会 POST `https://api.telegram.org/bot{token}/sendMessage`（`chat_id` + `text`，文本按 4096 截断）。出站失败仍 200 + 原 JSON `reply`，避免 Telegram 重试；可回传 `delivered` / `delivery_error`。未配置 token 时仅同步 JSON。用 Bot API `setWebhook` 将公网 HTTPS URL 指向本端点，并可设置 `secret_token`。",
        "security": [{ "telegramSecret": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TelegramUpdate" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "入站处理结果（含跳过）",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TelegramInboundResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Telegram secret token 不匹配",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookUnauthorized" }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/hooks/slack": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["hooks"],
        "summary": "Slack Events API 入站",
        "operationId": "inboundSlack",
        "description": "接收 Slack Events API JSON。先读取原始 body 字节再反序列化，以便配置 signing secret 时做官方 v0 HMAC-SHA256 校验（`X-Slack-Signature` + `X-Slack-Request-Timestamp`，时间窗 ±5 分钟）。`type=url_verification` 返回 `{ challenge }`。`event_callback` 仅处理 `event.type=message` 且 `subtype` 为空（忽略 `bot_message`、`message_changed` 等，避免环）；文本取 `event.text`，会话键 `slack:{team_id}:{channel}`（无 team 则为 `slack:{channel}`）。无文本或忽略的事件返回 200 + skipped。成功回复同步 JSON `{ ok, reply, session_id }`。配置了 `JIACLAW_SLACK_BOT_TOKEN` / `[http].slack_bot_token` 时，成功回复后 POST `https://slack.com/api/chat.postMessage`；出站失败仍 200 + 原 `reply`。未配置 signing secret 时开放（开发友好）。",
        "security": [{ "slackSignature": [], "slackTimestamp": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SlackEnvelope" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "URL 验证 `{ challenge }`，或入站处理结果（含跳过）",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SlackInboundResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Slack 签名或时间戳无效",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookUnauthorized" }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/hooks/discord": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["hooks"],
        "summary": "Discord Interactions 入站",
        "operationId": "inboundDiscord",
        "description": "接收 Discord Interactions HTTP JSON。先读取原始 body 字节再反序列化，以便配置公钥时做官方 Ed25519 校验（`X-Signature-Ed25519` + `X-Signature-Timestamp`，消息为 timestamp 与 raw body 拼接）。`type=1` PING 返回 `{ type: 1 }` PONG。`type=2` APPLICATION_COMMAND 仅处理 Chat Input（`data.type=1` 或省略）：文本取第一个 string option，否则用 `data.name` 加选项拼接；会话键 `discord:{guild_id}:{channel_id}`（无 guild 则为 `discord:dm:{channel_id}`）。立即返回 `{ type: 5 }` deferred ACK（满足 3s），后台跑 chat；配置了 `JIACLAW_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN` / `[http].discord_bot_token` 时再 PATCH 编辑原始消息。未配置公钥时开放（开发友好）；未配置 bot token 时仍 ACK 并写 session，但无法 follow-up。不支持 Incoming Webhook 简化体。",
        "security": [{ "discordSignature": [], "discordTimestamp": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DiscordInteraction" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "PING 为 `{ type: 1 }`；Chat Input Command 为 `{ type: 5 }` deferred；忽略的 interaction 为 type 4 短暂消息",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DiscordInteractionResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Discord Ed25519 签名无效",
            "headers": {
              "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookUnauthorized" }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "API token。未配置 token 时不需要。"
      },
      "apiToken": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Api-Token",
        "description": "Bearer 的替代头。未配置 token 时不需要。"
      },
      "webhookSecret": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Webhook-Secret",
        "description": "Webhook 密钥。未配置 secret 时不需要。"
      },
      "telegramSecret": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token",
        "description": "Telegram Bot API secret token。未配置 `JIACLAW_TELEGRAM_SECRET` / `[http].telegram_secret` 时不需要。"
      },
      "slackSignature": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Slack-Signature",
        "description": "Slack Events API v0 HMAC-SHA256 签名（`v0=<hex>`）。未配置 `JIACLAW_SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET` / `[http].slack_signing_secret` 时不需要。"
      },
      "slackTimestamp": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Slack-Request-Timestamp",
        "description": "Slack 请求 Unix 时间戳（秒）。与签名一起校验，时间窗 ±5 分钟。未配置 signing secret 时不需要。"
      },
      "discordSignature": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Signature-Ed25519",
        "description": "Discord Interactions Ed25519 签名（hex）。未配置 `JIACLAW_DISCORD_PUBLIC_KEY` / `[http].discord_public_key` 时不需要。"
      },
      "discordTimestamp": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Signature-Timestamp",
        "description": "Discord 请求时间戳。与 Ed25519 签名一起校验（消息为 timestamp + raw body）。未配置公钥时不需要。"
      }
    },
    "headers": {
      "XRequestId": {
        "description": "请求追踪 ID。请求未携带时由服务端生成 UUID。",
        "schema": { "type": "string" }
      },
      "RetryAfter": {
        "description": "限流后建议等待秒数",
        "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "API token 缺失或不匹配",
        "headers": {
          "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody" }
          }
        }
      },
      "NotFound": {
        "description": "会话不存在或已过期。JSON `error` 为 `session_not_found`。",
        "headers": {
          "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody" }
          }
        }
      },
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "超过进程内全局限流（429）。JSON `error` 为 `rate_limit_exceeded`。",
        "headers": {
          "X-Request-Id": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/XRequestId" },
          "Retry-After": { "$ref": "#/components/headers/RetryAfter" }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RateLimitError" }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "HealthResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["status", "agent_name", "version"],
        "properties": {
          "status": { "type": "string", "example": "ok" },
          "agent_name": { "type": "string" },
          "version": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "ChatMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["role", "content"],
        "properties": {
          "role": { "type": "string", "enum": ["user", "assistant", "system"] },
          "content": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "ChatRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["messages"],
        "properties": {
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatMessage" }
          },
          "enabled_tools": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string" },
            "default": []
          },
          "enabled_skills": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string" },
            "default": []
          },
          "auto_skills": { "type": "boolean", "default": true },
          "session_id": { "type": "string", "nullable": true },
          "stream": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "为 true 时返回 `text/event-stream`。也可通过请求头 `Accept: text/event-stream` 开启。未设置时保持 JSON。"
          }
        }
      },
      "ToolCall": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "tool_name": { "type": "string" },
          "arguments": {},
          "result": {}
        }
      },
      "ChatResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "message": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatMessage" },
          "tool_calls": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolCall" }
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["running", "completed", "failed", "requires_human_input"]
          },
          "session_id": { "type": "string", "nullable": true }
        }
      },
      "ChatSseStream": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Server-Sent Events。每条事件为 `event: <name>` + `data: <json>`。\n\n- `meta`: `{ session_id, request_id }`\n- `token`（或后续 `delta`）: `{ text }` assistant 文本增量。**当前为整轮 tool loop 完成后的按句/按块推送；Brokerrouter 真流式后续。**\n- `tool`: `{ name, ok }` 工具摘要；失败时带 `error`\n- `done`: `{ reply, status, session_id }` 最终回复后关闭流\n- `error`: `{ error }` 错误后关闭流\n\n鉴权失败不走 SSE，仍返回 JSON 401。"
      },
      "CreateSessionResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "session_id": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "SessionSummary": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "message_count"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string" },
          "message_count": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
        }
      },
      "ListSessionsResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["sessions"],
        "properties": {
          "sessions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SessionSummary" }
          }
        }
      },
      "GetSessionResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "messages"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string" },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatMessage" }
          }
        }
      },
      "DeleteSessionResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "success": { "type": "boolean" },
          "message": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "ToolInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "description": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "ToolsResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "tools": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolInfo" }
          }
        }
      },
      "SkillInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "description": { "type": "string" },
          "path": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "SkillsResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "skills": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SkillInfo" }
          }
        }
      },
      "InboundWebhookRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["chat_id", "text"],
        "properties": {
          "channel": { "type": "string", "default": "webhook" },
          "chat_id": { "type": "string" },
          "text": { "type": "string" },
          "username": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "InboundWebhookResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
          "session_id": { "type": "string" },
          "reply": { "type": "string" },
          "message": { "type": "string" },
          "error": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "TelegramChat": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id"],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "oneOf": [
              { "type": "integer", "format": "int64" },
              { "type": "string" }
            ],
            "description": "Telegram chat.id"
          }
        }
      },
      "TelegramMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["chat"],
        "properties": {
          "chat": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TelegramChat" },
          "text": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "TelegramUpdate": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Telegram Bot API Update 的最小子集；其余字段忽略。至少支持 message.text / edited_message.text。",
        "properties": {
          "update_id": { "type": "integer" },
          "message": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TelegramMessage" },
          "edited_message": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TelegramMessage" }
        }
      },
      "TelegramInboundResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ok"],
        "properties": {
          "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
          "reply": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "同步回传的 assistant 文本（有文本的 update）"
          },
          "session_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "telegram:{chat.id}"
          },
          "skipped": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "无文本 update 时为 true"
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "no text in update"
          },
          "delivered": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否已成功调用 Bot sendMessage。未配置 bot token 时省略该字段。"
          },
          "delivery_error": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "sendMessage 失败时的错误摘要（不含 token 明文）。出站失败不改变 HTTP 200。"
          }
        }
      },
      "SlackEvent": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "type": "string", "example": "message" },
          "subtype": { "type": "string", "description": "非空时忽略（如 bot_message、message_changed）" },
          "channel": { "type": "string" },
          "text": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "SlackEnvelope": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Slack Events API 信封最小子集；其余字段忽略。",
        "required": ["type"],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`url_verification` 或 `event_callback`"
          },
          "challenge": { "type": "string" },
          "team_id": { "type": "string" },
          "event": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SlackEvent" }
        }
      },
      "SlackInboundResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ok"],
        "properties": {
          "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
          "challenge": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "仅 `url_verification` 时返回该字段（响应体为 `{ challenge }`）"
          },
          "reply": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "同步回传的 assistant 文本（普通 message）"
          },
          "session_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "slack:{team_id}:{channel} 或 slack:{channel}"
          },
          "skipped": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "忽略的事件或无文本时为 true"
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "ignored message subtype"
          },
          "delivered": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否已成功调用 chat.postMessage。未配置 bot token 时省略该字段。"
          },
          "delivery_error": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "chat.postMessage 失败时的错误摘要（不含 token 明文）。出站失败不改变 HTTP 200。"
          }
        }
      },
      "DiscordCommandOption": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "type": { "type": "integer", "description": "3 = STRING" },
          "value": {},
          "options": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DiscordCommandOption" }
          }
        }
      },
      "DiscordInteractionData": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string", "example": "ask" },
          "type": { "type": "integer", "description": "1 = CHAT_INPUT" },
          "options": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DiscordCommandOption" }
          }
        }
      },
      "DiscordInteraction": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Discord Interactions 最小子集；其余字段忽略。不接受 Incoming Webhook 简化体。",
        "required": ["type"],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "1 = PING，2 = APPLICATION_COMMAND"
          },
          "application_id": { "type": "string" },
          "guild_id": { "type": "string" },
          "channel_id": { "type": "string" },
          "token": { "type": "string" },
          "data": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DiscordInteractionData" }
        }
      },
      "DiscordInteractionResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["type"],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "1 = PONG；4 = CHANNEL_MESSAGE_WITH_SOURCE（跳过时短暂消息）；5 = DEFERRED_CHANNEL_MESSAGE_WITH_SOURCE"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "content": { "type": "string" },
              "flags": { "type": "integer", "description": "64 = EPHEMERAL" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "WebhookUnauthorized": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": { "type": "boolean", "example": false },
          "error": { "type": "string", "example": "unauthorized" }
        }
      },
      "ErrorBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "RateLimitError": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": { "type": "string", "example": "rate_limit_exceeded" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
